{"id":"09b80989dbe14044","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-theory-system.md","title":"Classical System Presented by a Sentence Set","display":"df-theory-system — Classical System Presented by a Sentence Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-theory-system","aliases":["92-df-theory-system"],"display":"df-theory-system — Classical System Presented by a Sentence Set","source":"第 V 章 pp. 56–57（PDF 73–74）；本地呈现构造","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","[[92-df-signature]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-logical-axiom]]","[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","[[92-ax-generalization]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-theory-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-theory-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory-system — Classical System Presented by a Sentence Set"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 56–57（PDF 73–74）；本地呈现构造"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62f011418ee9c44e\" href=\"?note=62f011418ee9c44e\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-system\">92-df-arithmetic-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e948c25f4a467fa1\" href=\"?note=e948c25f4a467fa1\" title=\"92-df-logical-axiom\">92-df-logical-axiom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"16613851c4bce386\" href=\"?note=16613851c4bce386\" title=\"92-ax-modus-ponens\">92-ax-modus-ponens</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"906680bfce5f44c0\" href=\"?note=906680bfce5f44c0\" title=\"92-ax-generalization\">92-ax-generalization</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span>：作为非逻辑公理呈现的句子集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G,\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\">\\(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G,\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}\\)</span>：本地经典一阶语言、公理与规则。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G\\)</span>：算术语言上的经典演算谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G\\)</span> 为下文定义的构造器。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup T,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G&amp;:\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\longrightarrow\n\\{\\mathcal S\\mid\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)&amp;\\coloneqq\n(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup T,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G&amp;:\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\longrightarrow\n\\{\\mathcal S\\mid\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是非逻辑公理集，不包含所有开逻辑公理。因此必须显式并入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\)</span>；单有 MP/Gen 并不会自动提供一阶逻辑。</p>\n<p>句子集与形式系统三元组不同；可证关系写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\vdash X\">\\(\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\vdash X\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 对经典一阶后承闭合，由该演算的可靠性与完备性，才得到其闭句定理集等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>。此处不声称任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 都已闭合，也不把其成员关系假定为可判定。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 56–57（PDF 73–74）；本地呈现构造。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"62f011418ee9c44e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-logical-axiom","status":"resolved","id":"e948c25f4a467fa1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-axiom]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-modus-ponens","status":"resolved","id":"16613851c4bce386","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-modus-ponens]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-ax-generalization","status":"resolved","id":"906680bfce5f44c0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-ax-generalization]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G,\\mathrm{MP},\\mathrm{Gen}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sys}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory\\text{-}system}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)&\\coloneqq\n(\\Sigma_G,\\mathrm{LogAx}_G\\cup T,\\mathrm{MP}\\cup\\mathrm{Gen}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Sys}_G&:\\mathcal P(\\mathrm{Sent}_G)\\longrightarrow\n\\{\\mathcal S\\mid\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LogAx}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)\\vdash X","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false}],"bytes":1803,"backlinks":[{"id":"fceaada2b896f5e2","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sys}_G(B),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(U)$ (canonical formal-system presentations, see [[92-df-theory-system]])"},{"id":"3ccc8054e82f6b5d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e9a4da37b8e411f7","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)$ (canonical formal-system presentation, see [[92-df-theory-system]])"},{"id":"115b0689f1a67703","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"52184c84df392b80","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T'),\\mathrm{Sys}_G(T)$ (canonical formal-system presentations, see [[92-df-theory-system]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-system]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-theory-system]]"}],"outgoing":["62f011418ee9c44e","d666a3e3ee6c8148","90f32e29c9d553ed","e948c25f4a467fa1","16613851c4bce386","906680bfce5f44c0"]}